      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "reader-paper",
      "description": "Serif reading surface with responsive padding.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-paper\"><div class=\"ds-rule\"></div><h1>A quiet morning</h1><p>The room was warm.<br>A book waited on the table.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-paper{background:var(--surface,#fffefb);color:var(--ink,#243b34);padding:28px 22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 12px 36px #233c3315;min-height:410px}.ds-paper h1{font:400 2rem/1.15 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:12px 0 30px}.ds-paper p{font:1.35rem/2 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;max-width:40ch;white-space:pre-line}.ds-rule{width:42px;height:2px;background:var(--warm,#a44632);margin:6px 0 26px}@media(min-width:600px){.ds-paper{padding:42px 48px;min-height:460px}.ds-paper h1{font-size:2.5rem}.ds-paper p{font-size:1.6rem}}@media(min-width:960px){.ds-paper{padding:48px 64px}}"
